---
// HeroCatalogo.astro
---

<section class="pt-40 pb-20 relative overflow-hidden flex flex-col items-center justify-center min-h-[80vh]">
  <!-- Grid background for the clinical editorial feel -->
  <div class="absolute inset-0 z-0 opacity-[0.03]" style="background-image: radial-gradient(#fff 1px, transparent 1px); background-size: 30px 30px;"></div>
  
  <div class="relative z-10 text-center flex flex-col items-center px-4 w-full max-w-7xl mx-auto">
    <div class="mb-12">
      <!-- Vértice Logo Container -->
      <div class="adn-glass-card px-10 py-6 rounded-3xl flex items-center justify-center gap-5 border border-white/5 shadow-2xl">
        <svg viewBox="0 0 100 100" class="w-16 h-16" fill="none">
          <!-- Geometric Delta Logo -->
          <path d="M50 10 L10 80 L90 80 Z" fill="url(#grad1)" opacity="0.9"/>
          <path d="M50 10 L10 80 L50 80 Z" fill="url(#grad2)"/>
          <defs>
            <linearGradient id="grad1" x1="0%" y1="0%" x2="100%" y2="100%">
              <stop offset="0%" stop-color="#00E599" />
              <stop offset="100%" stop-color="#0080FF" />
            </linearGradient>
            <linearGradient id="grad2" x1="0%" y1="0%" x2="100%" y2="0%">
              <stop offset="0%" stop-color="#00E599" />
              <stop offset="100%" stop-color="transparent" />
            </linearGradient>
          </defs>
        </svg>
        <div class="flex flex-col text-left">
           <span class="text-4xl font-heading font-black text-sovereign-white tracking-widest leading-none drop-shadow-md">VÉRTICE</span>
      <span class="gradient-accent font-heading text-lg mt-1">EHS</span>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
    
    <div class="inline-block px-5 py-2.5 rounded-full bg-hazard-green/5 border border-hazard-green/20 backdrop-blur-md text-[10px] md:text-xs font-black tracking-[0.4em] text-hazard-green uppercase mb-10">
      CONSULTORÍA SENIOR EN SEGURIDAD, SALUD Y MEDIO AMBIENTE
    </div>
    
    <h1 class="text-[5rem] md:text-[8rem] font-bold font-heading mb-6 tracking-tighter text-sovereign-white leading-none drop-shadow-lg flex flex-col items-center">
      <span>VÉRTICE</span>
      <span class="gradient-title drop-shadow-[0_0_30px_rgba(0,229,153,0.2)]">EHS</span>
    </h1>
    
    <p class="text-xl md:text-2xl text-muted-steel max-w-3xl mx-auto leading-relaxed mt-6 font-medium">
      No somos gestores de firmas. Somos la línea de defensa definitiva entre tu patrimonio y las sanciones federales.
    </p>
    
    <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-center justify-center gap-6 mt-16">
      <a href="#contacto" class="btn-primary px-8 py-4 text-lg font-bold flex items-center gap-3 group bg-sovereign-white text-deep-void hover:bg-sovereign-white/90">
        <svg class="w-5 h-5 group-hover:scale-110 transition-transform" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
          <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M9 12l2 2 4-4m5.618-4.016A11.955 11.955 0 0112 2.944a11.955 11.955 0 01-8.618 3.04A12.02 12.02 0 003 9c0 5.591 3.824 10.29 9 11.622 5.176-1.332 9-6.03 9-11.622 0-1.042-.133-2.052-.382-3.016z"/>
        </svg>
        Blindar Mi Operación
      </a>
      <a href="#catalogo" class="px-8 py-4 text-lg font-bold text-sovereign-white border border-white/10 rounded-xl hover:bg-white/5 transition-all flex items-center gap-3 group">
        <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-muted-steel group-hover:translate-y-1 transition-transform" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
          <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M19 14l-7 7m0 0l-7-7m7 7V3"/>
        </svg>
        Conocer Más
      </a>
    </div>
  </div>
  
  <!-- Right-side pagination dots (decorative) -->
  <div class="absolute right-8 top-1/2 -translate-y-1/2 flex-col gap-4 hidden lg:flex z-20">
    <div class="w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-hazard-green shadow-[0_0_10px_#00e599]"></div>
    <div class="w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-white/20"></div>
    <div class="w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-white/20"></div>
    <div class="w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-white/20"></div>
    <div class="w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-white/20"></div>
    <div class="w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-white/20"></div>
    <div class="w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-white/20"></div>
  </div>
</section>
